  "overview": "Your IAE score suggests you're a 'big picture' thinker (Investigative) who uses your creative mind (Artistic) to develop and promote new business ideas (Enterprising). You enjoy spotting trends, analyzing complex market data, and then crafting an innovative vision or product and persuading others of its value. You're a blend of analyst, creator, and entrepreneur.",
