  "overview": "Your IRS score points to a person who loves to investigate the world (Investigative) through direct, hands-on fieldwork (Realistic) in a way that helps society or the environment (Social). You are an applied scientist or researcher who is passionate about using your knowledge to solve real-world problems for people and the planet.",
